# Copy to .env (gitignored). The YouTube Data API v3 key for
# pipeline_titles.ingest.fetch_publish_dates: Google Cloud Console -> a project ->
# APIs & Services -> Library -> "YouTube Data API v3" -> Enable -> Credentials ->
# Create credentials -> API key (restrict it to the YouTube Data API v3). Free:
# 10,000 quota units a day, and the whole corpus needs about 6,100.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=
